# Claude Code — global

Orientation, host facts, and how I like to work are in `~/AGENTS.md` (chezmoi `AGENTS.md.tmpl`),
which every session under `~` loads through the `~/CLAUDE.md` symlink. This file holds only what is
Claude-specific.

- Behavioral rules live in `~/.claude/rules/` and load automatically (`python`, `shell`, `django`
  only when matching files are touched). Do not duplicate them here or in any `AGENTS.md`.
- Persistent facts about me and my projects → auto memory (`MEMORY.md` index).
- Tuning how you write → the `style-tuner` skill, driven by the style-guard verdict log.
